<p>Shatter the spacetime continuum around yourself, inflicting <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">108, 146, 175, 200, 222</acronym> temporal damage to all targets within radius 10. Any atrophy stacks will be consumed to steal time from your victims, inflicting an additional <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">18, 24, 29, 33, 37</acronym> temporal damage and granting you <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1%, 3%, 4%, 5%, 7%</acronym> of a turn per stack (but no more than 3 turns).</p><p>The damage will scale with your Spellpower.</p>